# Bloodthirsty Conqueror triggers when an opponent LOSES life, and prevented damage causes none. Bot2's The One Ring gives it
# protection from everything until its next turn (CR 702.16j), which prevents all damage to it (CR 702.16e), so Bot1's
# Boltwave (damage to each opponent, no target) hurts nobody: Bot2 stays at 20, no life is lost and the Conqueror does not
# trigger - Bot1 stays at 20 and the stack is empty. (The control, where the same Boltwave costs 3 and gains 3:
# bloodthirsty-conqueror-triggers-for-each-opponent-that-loses-life.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Bloodthirsty Conqueror
Boltwave
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Volcanic Island
Black Lotus
The One Ring
Island
Island
Island
Island
Island x20

